  "project_description": "Module integration with Diputació de Barcelona (DiBa) services and site development. The base module bundles a curated set of hardening/utility contrib modules, adds site-configuration health checks (hook_requirements), removes the Drupal generator meta tag, and runs a cron job that purges stale temporary and Backup and Migrate (bam*) files. Corporate authentication (SAML SSO and the VUS web-service/Oracle validation), a Google Tag Manager cookie-consent layer, and legacy D10 add-ons are provided as optional submodules.",
